                                "sense_id": "d673229f-04e5-3be2-89ee-83b6f620025c",
                                "text": "Un jour, Léna apprendra les punitions qu’on réserve aux enfants des hautes castes qui se hasardent à toucher un Harijan, comme les appelait Gandhi. Elle entendra le témoignage de cet homme, contraint à l’âge de huit ans d’avaler de l’urine et de la bouse de vache pour expier sa faute.",
                                "translation": "One day, Lena will learn about the punishments reserved for high caste children who dare to touch a Harijan, as Gandhi called them. She will hear the testimony of this man, who at eight years old was forced to consume cow urine and cowpat to expiate his error.",
                                "english": "One day, Lena will learn about the punishments reserved for high caste children who dare to touch a Harijan, as Gandhi called them. She will hear the testimony of this man, who at eight years old was forced to consume cow urine and cowpat to expiate his error."
                            }
                        ]
